# Launcher scripts must keep the right line endings for their platform:
# cmd.exe misparses LF-only batch files; bash chokes on CRLF.
*.bat     text eol=crlf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf

# Node reference cards are written by `npm run gen:node-cards` with LF. Without
# this, core.autocrlf=true checks them out as CRLF, so on Windows every
# regenerated file reads as modified in `git status` while `git diff` shows
# nothing — the blobs normalize to identical content. Pinning LF makes a
# no-op regeneration leave a genuinely clean tree.
#
# They are also marked generated so review tools collapse them: a routine
# regeneration is a five-figure line diff that nobody should read by hand. Edit
# the generator, never these files.
public/node-cards/**/*.svg   text eol=lf linguist-generated=true
docs/reference/node-cards.md text eol=lf linguist-generated=true
